  "details": "This is an issue I only encountered with the beta, so I guess it is related to it.\nBasically in some worlds like this one https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_0f6b1149-da02-4079-997a-97dc0959973b other players can't see me moving from the spawn, an issue that doesn't get fixed after rejoining the world.\nWhen that issue happen, I can still move around the world, but not from other player's perspective, they also can't see my camera, but can hear the \"snap\" sound when I take a picture.\nSome of my friends also have the same issue, also with the IK beta.",
